ndicator 6.6 on The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE). Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included MOOE liquidation reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.7\",\"text\":\"The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.7 on The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Liquidation reports. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"}]}', 70.30, 'Advanced', '2002-03-13 02:15:00'),
