as a functional school-based ALS program. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included learner enrollment. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.7\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional child-protection committee.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.7 on The school has a functional child-protection committee. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included CPC composition order. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"2.8\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional DRRM plan.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.8 on The school has a functional DRRM plan. Records showed sustained implementation across the school. The supporting material included hazard maps. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"code\":\"2.9\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional support mechanism for mental wellness.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.9 on The school has a functional support mechanism for mental wellness. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Wellness program design. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.10\",\"text\":\"The school has special education- and PWD-friendly facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.10 on The school has special education- and PWD-friendly facilities. I found clear evidence that the practice was routinely maintained. The supporting material included Accessibility audit. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"}],\"Leadership\":[{\"code\":\"3.1\",\"text\":\"The school develops a strategic plan.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.1 on The school develops a strategic plan. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included accomplishment reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"3.2\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional school-community planning team.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.2 on The school has a functional school-community planning team. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included activity reports. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"code\":\"3.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional Supreme Student Government\\/Supreme Pupil Government.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.3 on The school has a functional Supreme Student Government\\/Supreme Pupil Government. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included program accomplishments. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"3.4\",\"text\":\"The school innovates in its provision of frontline services to stakeholders.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.4 on The school innovates in its provision of frontline services to stakeholders. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Innovation documentation. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"}],\"Governance and Accountability\":[{\"code\":\"4.1\",\"text\":\"The school\'s strategic plan is operationalized through an implementation plan.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.1 on The school\'s strategic plan is operationalized through an implementation plan. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included Implementation plan. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"4.2\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional School Governance Council (SGC).\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.2 on The school has a functional School Governance Council (SGC). Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included SGC composition order. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"4.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA).\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.3 on The school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA). I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included PTA election records. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"4.4\",\"text\":\"The school collaborates with stakeholders and other schools in strengthening partnerships.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.4 on The school collaborates with stakeholders and other schools in strengthening partnerships. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included MOA\\/MOU documents. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"4.5\",\"text\":\"The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.5 on The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities. I found little evidence that the practice had become established. The supporting material included monitoring reports. The team could identify an owner and collect evidence in the next review.\"},{\"code\":\"4.6\",\"text\":\"The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.6 on The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included tabulated data. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"}],\"Human Resources and Team Development\":[{\"code\":\"5.1\",\"text\":\"School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.1 on School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Signed IPCR forms. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"5.2\",\"text\":\"The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.2 on The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included OPCR rating sheets. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"5.3\",\"text\":\"The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.3 on The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included L&D records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"5.4\",\"text\":\"The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.4 on The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included PDO records. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"5.5\",\"text\":\"The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.5 on The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included Recognition program design. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"5.6\",\"text\":\"The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.6 on The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included allowance vouchers. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"5.7\",\"text\":\"Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.7 on Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included assignment orders. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"}],\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\":[{\"code\":\"6.1\",\"text\":\"The school inspects its infrastructure and facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.1 on The school inspects its infrastructure and facilities. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included photos. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"6.2\",\"text\":\"The school initiates improvement of its infrastructure and facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.2 on The school initiates improvement of its infrastructure and facilities. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included accomplishment reports. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional library.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included Library inventory. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.4\",\"text\":\"The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included Utility bills. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.5\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included equipment condition report. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.6\",\"text\":\"The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE).\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.6 on The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE). The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included COB vs. actual. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"6.7\",\"text\":\"The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.7 on The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included COA records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"}]}', 66.01, 'Advanced', '2003-02-28 02:15:00');
INSERT INTO `ml_training_snapshots` (`snapshot_id`, `school_id`, `cycle_id`, `dim_scores`, `indicator_ratings`, `overall_score`, `maturity_level`, `created_at`) VALUES
(164, 1, 179, '[{\"dimension_id\":1,\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"raw_score\":19.2,\"max_score\":32,\"percentage\":60},{\"dimension_id\":2,\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"raw_score\":30.9,\"max_score\":40,\"percentage\":77.25},{\"dimension_id\":3,\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"raw_score\":12.8,\"max_score\":16,\"percentage\":80},{\"dimension_id\":4,\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"raw_score\":14,\"max_score\":24,\"percentage\":58.33},{\"dimension_id\":5,\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"raw_score\":19.5,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":69.64},{\"dimension_id\":6,\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"raw_score\":20.1,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":71.79}]', '{\"Curriculum and Teaching\":[{\"code\":\"1.1\",\"text\":\"Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included MPS\\/proficiency data. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"1.2\",\"text\":\"Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT).\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). I saw regu