ion_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Lesson plans. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"1.7\",\"text\":\"The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included action plans based on findings. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"1.8\",\"text\":\"The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.8 on The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included industry immersion records. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"}],\"Learning Environment\":[{\"code\":\"2.1\",\"text\":\"The school has zero bullying incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.1 on The school has zero bullying incidence. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included Anti-bullying policy. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"2.2\",\"text\":\"The school has zero child abuse incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.2 on The school has zero child abuse incidence. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included CPC records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.3\",\"text\":\"The school has reduced its drop-out incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.3 on The school has reduced its drop-out incidence. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Enrollment\\/completion data. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.4\",\"text\":\"The school conducts culture-sensitive activities.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.4 on The school conducts culture-sensitive activities. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included Activity programs. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"code\":\"2.5\",\"text\":\"The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.5 on The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included ALS enrollment records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.6\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional school-based ALS program.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, ind