(165, 1, 180, '[{\"dimension_id\":1,\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"raw_score\":18.2,\"max_score\":32,\"percentage\":56.88},{\"dimension_id\":2,\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"raw_score\":29.4,\"max_score\":40,\"percentage\":73.5},{\"dimension_id\":3,\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"raw_score\":11.8,\"max_score\":16,\"percentage\":73.75},{\"dimension_id\":4,\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"raw_score\":17,\"max_score\":24,\"percentage\":70.83},{\"dimension_id\":5,\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"raw_score\":20.1,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":71.79},{\"dimension_id\":6,\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"raw_score\":19,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":67.86}]', '{\"Curriculum and Teaching\":[{\"code\":\"1.1\",\"text\":\"Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included class records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"1.2\",\"text\":\"Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT).\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included NAT results. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"1.3\",\"text\":\"School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.3 on School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included enrollment and completion records. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"1.4\",\"text\":\"Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.4 on Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Developed contextualized LMs. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"1.5\",\"text\":\"Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.5 on Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included Remediation program designs. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"1.6\",\"text\":\"Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included LAC session minutes. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"1.7\",\"text\":\"The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Item analysis reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"1.8\",\"text\":\"The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.8 on The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included MOA with industry partners. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"}],\"Learning Environment\":[{\"code\":\"2.1\",\"text\":\"The school has zero bullying incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.1 on The school has zero bullying incidence. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included incident reports. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"2.2\",\"text\":\"The school has zero child abuse incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.2 on The school has zero child abuse incidence. Records showed sustained implementation across the school. The supporting material included incident reports. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"code\":\"2.3\",\"text\":\"The school has reduced its drop-out incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.3 on The school has reduced its drop-out incidence. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included BEIS reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.4\",\"text\":\"The school conducts culture-sensitive activities.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.4 on The school conducts culture-sensitive activities. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included feedback forms. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.5\",\"text\":\"The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.5 on The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included OSY mapping. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"2.6\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional school-based ALS program.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.6 on The school has a functional school-based ALS program. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included completion reports. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"2.7\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional child-protection committee.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.7 on The school has a functional child-protection committee. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included meeting minutes. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.8\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional DRRM plan.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.8 on The school has a functional DRRM plan. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included drill documentation. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"code\":\"2.9\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional support mechanism for mental wellness.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.9 on The school has a functional support mechanism for mental wellness. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included accomplishment reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.10\",\"text\":\"The school has special education- and PWD-friendly facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.10 on The school has special education- and PWD-friendly facilities. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included SPED program records. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"}],\"Leadership\":[{\"code\":\"3.1\",\"text\":\"The school develops a strategic plan.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.1 on The school develops a strategic plan. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included accomplishment reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"3.2\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional school-community planning team.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.2 on The school has a functional school-community planning team. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included meeting minutes. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"3.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional Supreme Student Government\\/Supreme Pupil Government.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.3 on The school has a functional Supreme Student Government\\/Supreme Pupil Government. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included SSG\\/SPG constitution. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"3.4\",\"text\":\"The school innovates in its provision of frontline services to stakeholders.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.4 on The school innovates in its provision of frontline services to stakeholders. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Innovation documentation. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"}],\"Governance and Accountability\":[{\"code\":\"4.1\",\"text\":\"The school\'s strategic plan is operationalized through an implementation plan.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.1 on The school\'s strategic plan is operationalized through an implementation plan. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included M&E records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"4.2\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional School Governance Council (SGC).\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.2 on The school has a functional School Governance Council (SGC). The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included SGC composition order. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"4.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA).\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.3 on The school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA). I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included PTA election records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"4.4\",\"text\":\"The school collaborates with stakeholders and other schools in strengthening partnerships.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.4 on The school collaborates with stakeholders and other schools in strengthening partnerships. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included resource contributions. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"4.5\",\"text\":\"The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.5 on The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included action plans based on findings. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"4.6\",\"text\":\"The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.6 on The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included tabulated data. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"}],\"Human Resources and Team Development\":[{\"code\":\"5.1\",\"text\":\"School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.1 on School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included Signed IPCR forms. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"5.2\",\"text\":\"The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_nam