ed partnership activity reports. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"4.5\",\"text\":\"The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.5 on The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included action plans based on findings. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"4.6\",\"text\":\"The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.6 on The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Stakeholder satisfaction survey results. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"}],\"Human Resources and Team Development\":[{\"code\":\"5.1\",\"text\":\"School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.1 on School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included summary rating sheets. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"5.2\",\"text\":\"The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.2 on The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included division evaluation results. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"5.3\",\"text\":\"The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.3 on The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included L&D records. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"code\":\"5.4\",\"text\":\"The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.4 on The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included individual development plans. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"5.5\",\"text\":\"The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.5 on The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included awarding documentation. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"5.6\",\"text\":\"The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.6 on The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included DTR. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"5.7\",\"text\":\"Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.7 on Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included class schedule. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"}],\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\":[{\"code\":\"6.1\",\"text\":\"The school inspects its infrastructure and facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.1 on The school inspects its infrastructure and facilities. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included checklist. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.2\",\"text\":\"The school initiates improvement of its infrastructure and facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.2 on The school initiates improvement of its infrastructure and facilities. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included work orders. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional library.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included utilization logs. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.4\",\"text\":\"The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Utility bills. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.5\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included Lab inventory. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.6\",\"text\":\"The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE).\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.6 on The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE). The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included COB vs. actual. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.7\",\"text\":\"The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.7 on The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included Liquidation reports. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"}]}', 66.49, 'Advanced', '2007-03-02 02:15:00');
INSERT INTO `ml_training_snapshots` (`snapshot_id`, `school_id`, `cycle_id`, `dim_scores`, `indicator_ratings`, `overall_score`, `maturity_level`, `created_at`) VALUES
(168, 1, 183, '[{\"dimension_id\":1,\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"raw_score\":16.2,\"max_score\":32,\"percentage\":50.63},{\"dimension_id\":2,\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"raw_score\":26.3,\"max_score\":40,\"percentage\":65.75},{\"dimension_id\":3,\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"raw_score\":10.2,\"max_score\":16,\"percentage\":63.75},{\"dimension_id\":4,\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"raw_score\":11,\"max_score\":24,\"percentage\":45.83},{\"dimension_id\":5,\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"raw_score\":16.9,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":60.36},{\"dimension_id\":6,\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"raw_score\":16,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":57.14}]', '{\"Curriculum and Teaching\":[{\"code\":\"1.1\",\"text\":\"Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included early language and literacy assessment results. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"1.2\",\"text\":\"Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT).\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). I found little evidence that the practice had become established. The supporting material included NAT results. The team could identify an owner and collect evidence in the next review.\"},{\"code\":\"1.3\",\"text\":\"School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.3 on School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included enrollment and completion records. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"1.4\",\"text\":\"Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.4 on Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included LRMDS uploads. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"1.5\",\"text\":\"Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.5 on Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. The activity was not visible consistently in my review. The supporting material included monitoring reports. A dated follow-up record would help establish the next steps.\"},{\"code\":\"1.6\",\"text\":\"Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included classroom observations. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"1.7\",\"text\":\"The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included LAC minutes. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"1.8\",\"text\":\"The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.8 on The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included industry immersion records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"}],\"Learning Environment\":[{\"code\":\"2.1\",\"text\":\"The school has zero bullying incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.1 on The school has zero bullying incidence. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Anti-bullying policy. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.2\",\"text\":\"The school has zero child abuse incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.2 on The school has zero child abuse incidence. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included referral documents. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.3\",\"text\":\"The school has reduced its drop-out incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.3 on The school has reduced its drop-out incidence. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included BEIS reports. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.4\",\"text\":\"The school conducts culture-sensitive activities.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.4 on The school conducts culture-sensitive activities. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included Activity programs. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"2.5\",\"text\":\"The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.5 on The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included ALS enrollment records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.6\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional school-based ALS program.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.6 o