ment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.2 on The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included OPCR rating sheets. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"5.3\",\"text\":\"The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.3 on The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included action plans. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"5.4\",\"text\":\"The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.4 on The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included individual development plans. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"5.5\",\"text\":\"The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.5 on The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included photos. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"5.6\",\"text\":\"The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.6 on The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included allowance vouchers. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"5.7\",\"text\":\"Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.7 on Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included assignment orders. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"}],\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\":[{\"code\":\"6.1\",\"text\":\"The school inspects its infrastructure and facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.1 on The school inspects its infrastructure and facilities. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included Facilities inspection report. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"6.2\",\"text\":\"The school initiates improvement of its infrastructure and facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.2 on The school initiates improvement of its infrastructure and facilities. The available records did not yet show this being carried out. The supporting material included accomplishment reports. A dated follow-up record would help establish the next steps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional library.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. I found little evidence that the practice had become established. The supporting material included utilization logs. The team could identify an owner and collect evidence in the next review.\"},{\"code\":\"6.4\",\"text\":\"The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. The activity was not visible consistently in my review. The supporting material included functionality assessment. A dated follow-up record would help establish the next steps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.5\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included Lab inventory. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"6.6\",\"text\":\"The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE).\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.6 on The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE). The available records did not yet show this being carried out. The supporting material included MOOE liquidation reports. A dated follow-up record would help establish the next steps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.7\",\"text\":\"The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.7 on The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE. I found little evidence that the practice had become established. The supporting material included Liquidation reports. The team could identify an owner and collect evidence in the next review.\"}]}', 40.83, 'Maturing', '2011-03-04 02:15:00');
INSERT INTO `ml_training_snapshots` (`snapshot_id`, `school_id`, `cycle_id`, `dim_scores`, `indicator_ratings`, `overall_score`, `maturity_level`, `created_at`) VALUES
(172, 1, 187, '[{\"dimension_id\":1,\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"raw_score\":14.7,\"max_score\":32,\"percentage\":45.94},{\"dimension_id\":2,\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"raw_score\":23.9,\"max_score\":40,\"percentage\":59.75},{\"dimension_id\":3,\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"raw_score\":9.7,\"max_score\":16,\"percentage\":60.63},{\"dimension_id\":4,\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"raw_score\":11,\"max_score\":24,\"percentage\":45.83},{\"dimension_id\":5,\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"raw_score\":15.5,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":55.36},{\"dimension_id\":6,\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"raw_score\":14.2,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":50.71}]', '{\"Curriculum and Teaching\":[{\"code\":\"1.1\",\"text\":\"Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included MPS\\/proficiency data. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"1.2\",\"text\":\"Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT).\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included MPS data. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"1.3\",\"text\":\"School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.3 on School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included ALS completion certificates. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"1.4\",\"text\":\"Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.4 on Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included utilization records. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"1.5\",\"text\":\"Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.5 on Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included Remediation program designs. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"1.6\",\"text\":\"Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included classroom observations. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"1.7\",\"text\":\"The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included Item analysis reports. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"1.8\",\"text\":\"The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.8 on The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included industry immersion records. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"}],\"Learning Environment\":[{\"code\":\"2.1\",\"text\":\"The school has zero bullying incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.1 on The school has zero bullying incidence. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included incident reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.2\",\"text\":\"The school has zero child abuse incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.2 on The school has zero child abuse incidence. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included referral documents. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.3\",\"text\":\"The school has reduced its drop-out incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.3 on The school has reduced its drop-out incidence. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included Enrollment\\/completion data. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"2.4\",\"text\":\"The school conducts culture-sensitive activities.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.4 on The school conducts culture-sensitive activities. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included Activity programs. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"2.5\",\"text\":\"The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.5 on The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included ALS enrollment records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.6\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional school-based ALS program.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.6 on The school has a functional school-based ALS program. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included learner enrollment. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"2.7\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional child-protection committee.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.7 on The school has a functional child-protection committee. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included activity reports. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"2.8\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional DRRM plan.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.8 on The school has a functional DRRM plan. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included hazard maps. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.9\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional support mechanism for mental wellness.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.9 on The school has a functional support mechanism for mental wellness. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included referral records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.10\",\"text\":\"The school has special education- and PWD-friendly facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.10 on The school has special education- and PWD-friendly facilities. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included SPED program records. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"}],\"Leadership\":[{\"code\":\"3.1\",\"text\":\"The school develops a strategic plan.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.1 on The school develops a strategic plan. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included stakeholder attendance. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"3.2\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional school-community planning team.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.2 on The school has a functional school-community planning team. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included meeting minutes. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"3.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional Supreme Student Government\\/Supreme Pupil Government.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.3 on The school has a functional Supreme Student Government\\/Supreme Pupil Government. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included SSG\\/SPG constitution. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"3.4\",\"text\":\"The school innovates in its provision of frontline services to stakeholders.\",\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 3.4 on The school innovates in its provision of frontline services to stakeholders. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included impact data. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"}],\"Governance and Accountability\":[{\"code\":\"4.1\",\"text\":\"The school\'s strategic plan is operationalized through an implementation plan.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.1 on The school\'s strategic plan is operationalized through an implementation plan. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included Implementation plan. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"4.2\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional School Governance Council (SGC).\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.2 on The school has a functional School Governance Council (SGC). I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included meeting minutes. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"4.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA).\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.3 on The school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA). Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included PTA election records. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"4.4\",\"text\":\"The school collaborates with stakeholders and other schools in strengthening partnerships.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.4 on The school collaborates with stakeholders and other schools in strengthening partnerships. I found little evidence that the practice had become established. The supporting material included MOA\\/MOU documents. A dated follow-up record would help establish the next steps.\"},{\"code\":\"4.5\",\"text\":\"The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.5 on The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities. The available records did not yet show this being carried out. The supporting material included monitoring reports. The team could identify an owner and collect evidence in the next review.\"},{\"code\":\"4.6\",\"text\":\"The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.6 on The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included Stakeholder satisfaction survey results. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"}],\"Human Resources and Team Development\":[{\"code\":\"5.1\",\"text\":\"School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":1,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.1 on School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review. The available records did not yet show this being carried out. The supporting material included submission records. The team could identify an owner and collect evidence in the next review.\"},{\"code\":\"5.2\",\"text\":\"The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance co