e supporting material included work orders. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"6.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional library.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included Library inventory. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.4\",\"text\":\"The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Utility bills. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.5\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included Lab inventory. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"6.6\",\"text\":\"The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE).\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.6 on The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE). The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included MOOE liquidation reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.7\",\"text\":\"The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.7 on The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included COA records. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"}]}', 68.04, 'Advanced', '2015-03-06 02:15:00');
