(176, 1, 191, '[{\"dimension_id\":1,\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"raw_score\":20.4,\"max_score\":32,\"percentage\":63.75},{\"dimension_id\":2,\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"raw_score\":28.1,\"max_score\":40,\"percentage\":70.25},{\"dimension_id\":3,\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"raw_score\":12.9,\"max_score\":16,\"percentage\":80.63},{\"dimension_id\":4,\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"raw_score\":15,\"max_score\":24,\"percentage\":62.5},{\"dimension_id\":5,\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"raw_score\":21.5,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":76.79},{\"dimension_id\":6,\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"raw_score\":19.9,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":71.07}]', '{\"Curriculum and Teaching\":[{\"code\":\"1.1\",\"text\":\"Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included MPS\\/proficiency data. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"1.2\",\"text\":\"Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT).\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included class records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"1.3\",\"text\":\"School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.3 on School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included enrollment and completion records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"1.4\",\"text\":\"Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.4 on Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Developed contextualized LMs. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"1.5\",\"text\":\"Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.5 on Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included attendance records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"1.6\",\"text\":\"Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included LAC session minutes. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"1.7\",\"text\":\"The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Item analysis reports. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"1.8\",\"text\":\"The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.8 on The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included NC\\/COC certificates. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"}],\"Learning Environment\":[{\"code\":\"2.1\",\"text\":\"The school has zero bullying incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.1 on The school has zero bullying incidence. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included incident reports. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.2\",\"text\":\"The school has zero child abuse incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.2 on The school has zero child abuse incidence. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included referral documents. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"2.3\",\"text\":\"The school has reduced its drop-out incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.3 on The school has reduced its drop-out incidence. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included intervention records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"2.4\",\"text\":\"The school conducts culture-sensitive activities.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.4 on The school conducts culture-sensitive activities. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included feedback forms. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"2.5\",\"text\":\"The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.5 on The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included OSY mapping. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"2.6\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional school-based ALS program.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.