nt\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.2 on The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included OPCR rating sheets. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"code\":\"5.3\",\"text\":\"The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.3 on The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included attendance. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"5.4\",\"text\":\"The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.4 on The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Training certificates. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"5.5\",\"text\":\"The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.5 on The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included awarding documentation. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"