ew period. The supporting material included accomplishment reports. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"6.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional library.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included acquisition records. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"6.4\",\"text\":\"The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Utility bills. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"6.5\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included equipment condition report. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.6\",\"text\":\"The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE).\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.6 on The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE). The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included COB vs. actual. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"6.7\",\"text\":\"The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.7 on The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included COA records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"}]}', 75.77, 'Advanced', '2017-02-24 02:15:00');
