ource contributions. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"4.5\",\"text\":\"The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.5 on The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included monitoring reports. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"4.6\",\"text\":\"The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.6 on The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included Stakeholder satisfaction survey results. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"}],\"Human Resources and Team Development\":[{\"code\":\"5.1\",\"text\":\"School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.1 on School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Signed IPCR forms. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"5.2\",\"text\":\"The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_nam