ities. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included Maintenance\\/improvement plan. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional library.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included utilization logs. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"6.4\",\"text\":\"The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Utility bills. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.5\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Lab inventory. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"6.6\",\"text\":\"The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE).\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.6 on The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE). I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included MOOE liquidation reports. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"6.7\",\"text\":\"The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.7 on The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included COA records. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"}]}', 70.36, 'Advanced', '2020-03-13 02:15:00'),
