 material included feedback\\/evaluation. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"}],\"Governance and Accountability\":[{\"code\":\"4.1\",\"text\":\"The school\'s strategic plan is operationalized through an implementation plan.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.1 on The school\'s strategic plan is operationalized through an implementation plan. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included M&E records. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"4.2\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional School Governance Council (SGC).\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.2 on The school has a functional School Governance Council (SGC). The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included meeting minutes. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.\"},{\"code\":\"4.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA).\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.3 on The school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA). There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included financial reports. The next review should compare the available records across classes.\"},{\"code\":\"4.4\",\"text\":\"The school collaborates with stakeholders and other schools in strengthening partnerships.\",\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"rating\":2,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 4.4 on The school collaborates with stakeholders and other schools in strengthening partnerships. Some classes 