ating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.2 on The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review. Records showed sustained implementation across the school. The supporting material included division evaluation results. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"5.3\",\"text\":\"The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.3 on The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included LAC session plans. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"5.4\",\"text\":\"The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.4 on The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included individual development plans. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"5.5\",\"text\":\"The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel.\",\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 5.5 on The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included photos. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"cod