aterial included work orders. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"6.3\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional library.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Library inventory. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"6.4\",\"text\":\"The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included Utility bills. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.\"},{\"code\":\"6.5\",\"text\":\"The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory\\/classroom. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included utilization records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"6.6\",\"text\":\"The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE).\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.6 on The school achieves a 75\\u2013100% utilization rate of its Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE). The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included utilization matrix. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"6.7\",\"text\":\"The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE.\",\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 6.7 on The school liquidates 100% of its utilized MOOE. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included COA records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"}]}', 84.29, 'Advanced', '2025-02-28 02:15:00');
