(186, 1, 201, '[{\"dimension_id\":1,\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"raw_score\":26.3,\"max_score\":32,\"percentage\":82.19},{\"dimension_id\":2,\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"raw_score\":37.3,\"max_score\":40,\"percentage\":93.25},{\"dimension_id\":3,\"dimension_no\":3,\"dimension_name\":\"Leadership\",\"raw_score\":15.6,\"max_score\":16,\"percentage\":97.5},{\"dimension_id\":4,\"dimension_no\":4,\"dimension_name\":\"Governance and Accountability\",\"raw_score\":23,\"max_score\":24,\"percentage\":95.83},{\"dimension_id\":5,\"dimension_no\":5,\"dimension_name\":\"Human Resources and Team Development\",\"raw_score\":26,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":92.86},{\"dimension_id\":6,\"dimension_no\":6,\"dimension_name\":\"Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization\",\"raw_score\":23.2,\"max_score\":28,\"percentage\":82.86}]', '{\"Curriculum and Teaching\":[{\"code\":\"1.1\",\"text\":\"Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. Records showed sustained implementation across the school. The supporting material included MPS\\/proficiency data. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"code\":\"1.2\",\"text\":\"Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT).\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). Most of the evide