:1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included LAC session minutes. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"},{\"code\":\"1.7\",\"text\":\"The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Item analysis reports. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.\"},{\"code\":\"1.8\",\"text\":\"The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings.\",\"dimension_no\":1,\"dimension_name\":\"Curriculum and Teaching\",\"rating\":3,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 1.8 on The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included NC\\/COC certificates. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.\"}],\"Learning Environment\":[{\"code\":\"2.1\",\"text\":\"The school has zero bullying incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environment\",\"rating\":4,\"evidence\":\"In my school-level review, indicator 2.1 on The school has zero bullying incidence. Records showed sustained implementation across the school. The supporting material included monitoring logs. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.\"},{\"code\":\"2.2\",\"text\":\"The school has zero child abuse incidence.\",\"dimension_no\":2,\"dimension_name\":\"Learning Environme