(7047, 177, 1, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included early language and literacy assessment results. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:10:00'),
(7048, 177, 2, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included class records. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:11:00'),
(7049, 177, 3, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.3 on School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included enrollment and completion records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:12:00'),
(7050, 177, 4, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.4 on Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included utilization records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:13:00'),
(7051, 177, 5, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.5 on Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included monitoring reports. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:14:00'),
(7052, 177, 6, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included LAC session minutes. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:15:00'),
(7053, 177, 7, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included action plans based on findings. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:16:00'),
(7054, 177, 8, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.8 on The school engages local industries to strengthen its TLE-TVL course offerings. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included industry immersion records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:17:00'),
(7055, 177, 9, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.1 on The school has zero bullying incidence. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included incident reports. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:18:00'),
(7056, 177, 18, 1, 4, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.10 on The school has special education- and PWD-friendly facilities. I found clear evidence that the practice was routinely maintained. The supporting material included ramp/facility photos. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:19:00'),
(7057, 177, 10, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.2 on The school has zero child abuse incidence. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included incident reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:20:00'),
(7058, 177, 11, 1, 4, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.3 on The school has reduced its drop-out incidence. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included Enrollment/completion data. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:21:00'),
(7059, 177, 12, 1, 4, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.4 on The school conducts culture-sensitive activities. I found clear evidence that the practice was routinely maintained. The supporting material included Activity programs. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:22:00'),
(7060, 177, 13, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.5 on The school provides access to learning experiences for the disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included inclusion program documents. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:23:00'),
(7061, 177, 14, 1, 4, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.6 on The school has a functional school-based ALS program. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included completion reports. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:24:00'),
(7062, 177, 15, 1, 4, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.7 on The school has a functional child-protection committee. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included meeting minutes. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:25:00'),
(7063, 177, 16, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.8 on The school has a functional DRRM plan. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included DRRM plan. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:26:00'),
(7064, 177, 17, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 2.9 on The school has a functional support mechanism for mental wellness. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Wellness program design. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:27:00'),
(7065, 177, 19, 1, 4, 'In my school-level review, indicator 3.1 on The school develops a strategic plan. Records showed sustained implementation across the school. The supporting material included SIP/strategic plan document. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:28:00'),
(7066, 177, 20, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 3.2 on The school has a functional school-community planning team. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included Planning team composition. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:29:00'),
(7067, 177, 21, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 3.3 on The school has a functional Supreme Student Government/Supreme Pupil Government. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included SSG/SPG constitution. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:30:00'),
(7068, 177, 22, 1, 4, 'In my school-level review, indicator 3.4 on The school innovates in its provision of frontline services to stakeholders. I found clear evidence that the practice was routinely maintained. The supporting material included Innovation documentation. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:31:00'),
(7069, 177, 23, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 4.1 on The school\'s strategic plan is operationalized through an implementation plan. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included Implementation plan. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:32:00'),
(7070, 177, 24, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 4.2 on The school has a functional School Governance Council (SGC). I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included meeting minutes. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:33:00'),
(7071, 177, 25, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 4.3 on The school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA). The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included PTA election records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:34:00'),
(7072, 177, 26, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 4.4 on The school collaborates with stakeholders and other schools in strengthening partnerships. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included partnership activity reports. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:35:00'),
(7073, 177, 27, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 4.5 on The school monitors and evaluates its programs, projects, and activities. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included M&E plan. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:36:00'),
(7074, 177, 28, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 4.6 on The school maintains an average rating of satisfactory from its internal and external stakeholders. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included tabulated data. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:37:00'),
(7075, 177, 29, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 5.1 on School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included Signed IPCR forms. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:38:00'),
(7076, 177, 30, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 5.2 on The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the office performance commitment and review. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included OPCR rating sheets. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:39:00'),
(7077, 177, 31, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 5.3 on The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included minutes. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:40:00'),
(7078, 177, 32, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 5.4 on The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Training certificates. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 37, '2002-03-08 01:41:00'),
