(7173, 180, 1, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included class records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 37, '2005-03-07 01:10:00'),
(7174, 180, 2, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included NAT results. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2005-03-07 01:11:00'),
(7175, 180, 3, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.3 on School-based ALS learners attain certification as elementary and junior high school completers. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included enrollment and completion records. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 37, '2005-03-07 01:12:00'),
(7176, 180, 4, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.4 on Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Developed contextualized LMs. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2005-03-07 01:13:00'),
(7177, 180, 5, 1, 2, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.5 on Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included Remediation program designs. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 37, '2005-03-07 01:14:00'),
(7178, 180, 6, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included LAC session minutes. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 37, '2005-03-07 01:15:00'),
(7179, 180, 7, 1, 3, 'In my school-level review, indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Item analysis reports. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 37, '2005-03-07 01:16:00');
