(17900, 179, 32, 1, 12, 3, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 5.4 on The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included PDO records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2004-02-19 14:22:00', '2004-02-19 00:13:00', '2004-02-19 06:22:00'),
(17901, 179, 33, 1, 12, 2, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 5.5 on The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included photos. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.', 'submitted', '2004-02-19 14:22:00', '2004-02-19 00:13:00', '2004-02-19 06:22:00'),
(17902, 179, 34, 1, 12, 3, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 5.6 on The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included Payroll records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2004-02-19 14:22:00', '2004-02-19 00:13:00', '2004-02-19 06:22:00'),
(17903, 179, 35, 1, 12, 3, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 5.7 on Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included Teaching load summary. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2004-02-19 14:22:00', '2004-02-19 00:13:00', '2004-02-19 06:22:00'),
(17904, 179, 38, 1, 12, 2, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included Library inventory. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.', 'submitted', '2004-02-19 14:22:00', '2004-02-19 00:13:00', '2004-02-19 06:22:00'),
(17905, 179, 39, 1, 12, 2, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included Utility bills. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 'submitted', '2004-02-19 14:22:00', '2004-02-19 00:13:00', '2004-02-19 06:22:00'),
(17906, 179, 40, 1, 12, 3, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory/classroom. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Lab inventory. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2004-02-19 14:22:00', '2004-02-19 00:13:00', '2004-02-19 06:22:00'),
