(18179, 181, 40, 1, 15, 2, 'In my day-to-day work with this indicator indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory/classroom. Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included Lab inventory. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 'submitted', '2006-03-08 14:31:00', '2006-03-08 00:18:00', '2006-03-08 06:31:00'),
(18180, 182, 1, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included early language and literacy assessment results. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18181, 182, 2, 1, 2, 2, 'During my classroom review indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). Some classes showed the practice, but it was not consistent yet. The supporting material included class records. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18182, 182, 4, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 1.4 on Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Developed contextualized LMs. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18183, 182, 5, 1, 2, 2, 'During my classroom review indicator 1.5 on Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included attendance records. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18184, 182, 6, 1, 2, 1, 'During my classroom review indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. The activity was not visible consistently in my review. The supporting material included LAC session minutes. A dated follow-up record would help establish the next steps.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18185, 182, 7, 1, 2, 2, 'During my classroom review indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included action plans based on findings. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18186, 182, 9, 1, 2, 2, 'During my classroom review indicator 2.1 on The school has zero bullying incidence. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included incident reports. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18187, 182, 10, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 2.2 on The school has zero child abuse incidence. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included CPC records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18188, 182, 11, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 2.3 on The school has reduced its drop-out incidence. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included intervention records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18189, 182, 12, 1, 2, 2, 'During my classroom review indicator 2.4 on The school conducts culture-sensitive activities. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included feedback forms. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18190, 182, 17, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 2.9 on The school has a functional support mechanism for mental wellness. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Wellness program design. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18191, 182, 21, 1, 2, 4, 'During my classroom review indicator 3.3 on The school has a functional Supreme Student Government/Supreme Pupil Government. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included election records. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18192, 182, 29, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 5.1 on School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included submission records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00'),
(18193, 182, 31, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 5.3 on The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included minutes. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2007-02-13 14:30:00', '2007-02-13 00:15:00', '2007-02-13 06:30:00');
