(18387, 183, 38, 1, 15, 2, 'In my day-to-day work with this indicator indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. There were signs of progress, with important gaps still present. The supporting material included utilization logs. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.', 'submitted', '2008-02-29 14:37:00', '2008-02-29 00:20:00', '2008-02-29 06:37:00'),
