(19771, 197, 34, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 5.6 on The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included allowance vouchers. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2022-02-15 14:40:00', '2022-02-15 00:30:00', '2022-02-15 06:40:00'),
(19772, 197, 35, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 5.7 on Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included class schedule. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2022-02-15 14:40:00', '2022-02-15 00:30:00', '2022-02-15 06:40:00'),
(19773, 197, 38, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included acquisition records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2022-02-15 14:40:00', '2022-02-15 00:30:00', '2022-02-15 06:40:00'),
(19774, 197, 39, 1, 2, 2, 'During my classroom review indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. The practice appeared in a few records but needs steadier follow-through. The supporting material included functionality assessment. The next review should compare the available records across classes.', 'submitted', '2022-02-15 14:40:00', '2022-02-15 00:30:00', '2022-02-15 06:40:00'),
(19775, 197, 40, 1, 2, 3, 'During my classroom review indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory/classroom. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included equipment condition report. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2022-02-15 14:40:00', '2022-02-15 00:30:00', '2022-02-15 06:40:00'),
(19776, 197, 1, 1, 12, 2, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. I found some evidence, although implementation was uneven. The supporting material included early language and literacy assessment results. A short monitoring check could help close the implementation gaps.', 'submitted', '2022-02-17 14:41:00', '2022-02-17 00:31:00', '2022-02-17 06:41:00'),
(19777, 197, 2, 1, 12, 3, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 1.2 on Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st-century skills and core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT). The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included class records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2022-02-17 14:41:00', '2022-02-17 00:31:00', '2022-02-17 06:41:00'),
(19778, 197, 4, 1, 12, 3, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 1.4 on Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included LRMDS uploads. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2022-02-17 14:41:00', '2022-02-17 00:31:00', '2022-02-17 06:41:00'),
(19779, 197, 5, 1, 12, 1, 'In checking the records available to me indicator 1.5 on Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. I could not verify this practice in the materials I reviewed. The supporting material included Remediation program designs. A dated follow-up record would help establish the next steps.', 'submitted', '2022-02-17 14:41:00', '2022-02-17 00:31:00', '2022-02-17 06:41:00'),
