(20250, 201, 29, 1, 14, 3, 'While reviewing the supporting materials indicator 5.1 on School personnel achieve an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance commitment and review. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included summary rating sheets. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-02-25 00:37:00', '2026-02-25 06:20:00'),
(20251, 201, 31, 1, 14, 4, 'While reviewing the supporting materials indicator 5.3 on The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities. The reviewed evidence consistently confirmed this practice. The supporting material included minutes. The team can share this practice while continuing routine monitoring.', 'submitted', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-02-25 00:37:00', '2026-02-25 06:20:00'),
(20252, 201, 32, 1, 14, 3, 'While reviewing the supporting materials indicator 5.4 on The school facilitates the promotion and continuous professional development of its personnel. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included individual development plans. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-02-25 00:37:00', '2026-02-25 06:20:00'),
(20253, 201, 33, 1, 14, 3, 'While reviewing the supporting materials indicator 5.5 on The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included awarding documentation. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-02-25 00:37:00', '2026-02-25 06:20:00'),
(20254, 201, 34, 1, 14, 4, 'While reviewing the supporting materials indicator 5.6 on The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner. The evidence reflected consistent implementation throughout the year. The supporting material included personnel feedback. Maintaining the documentation will help sustain this result.', 'submitted', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-02-25 00:37:00', '2026-02-25 06:20:00'),
(20255, 201, 35, 1, 14, 3, 'While reviewing the supporting materials indicator 5.7 on Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included assignment orders. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-02-25 00:37:00', '2026-02-25 06:20:00'),
(20256, 201, 38, 1, 14, 3, 'While reviewing the supporting materials indicator 6.3 on The school has a functional library. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included acquisition records. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-02-25 00:37:00', '2026-02-25 06:20:00'),
(20257, 201, 39, 1, 14, 3, 'While reviewing the supporting materials indicator 6.4 on The school has functional water, electricity, and internet facilities. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Utility bills. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-02-25 00:37:00', '2026-02-25 06:20:00'),
(20258, 201, 40, 1, 14, 3, 'While reviewing the supporting materials indicator 6.5 on The school has a functional computer laboratory/classroom. I saw regular implementation across most of the reviewed material. The supporting material included Lab inventory. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-02-25 00:37:00', '2026-02-25 06:20:00'),
(20259, 201, 1, 1, 15, 3, 'In my day-to-day work with this indicator indicator 1.1 on Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included class records. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2026-02-27 14:21:00', '2026-02-27 00:38:00', '2026-02-27 06:21:00'),
