(20262, 201, 5, 1, 15, 3, 'In my day-to-day work with this indicator indicator 1.5 on Teachers conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Remediation program designs. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2026-02-27 14:21:00', '2026-02-27 00:38:00', '2026-02-27 06:21:00'),
(20263, 201, 6, 1, 15, 3, 'In my day-to-day work with this indicator indicator 1.6 on Teachers integrate topics promoting peace and DepEd core values. Most of the evidence showed the practice being carried out regularly. The supporting material included classroom observations. Keeping the records current will support the next improvement cycle.', 'submitted', '2026-02-27 14:21:00', '2026-02-27 00:38:00', '2026-02-27 06:21:00'),
(20264, 201, 7, 1, 15, 3, 'In my day-to-day work with this indicator indicator 1.7 on The school conducts test item analysis to inform its teaching and learning process. The practice was generally evident during the review period. The supporting material included LAC minutes. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2026-02-27 14:21:00', '2026-02-27 00:38:00', '2026-02-27 06:21:00'),
(20265, 201, 9, 1, 15, 3, 'In my day-to-day work with this indicator indicator 2.1 on The school has zero bullying incidence. The records indicate an established approach with room to improve. The supporting material included Anti-bullying policy. Periodic monitoring can help make the approach more even.', 'submitted', '2026-02-27 14:21:00', '2026-02-27 00:38:00', '2026-02-27 06:21:00'),
